🔹 STEP 21 — Wallet Creation API Implementation
Objective
Implement the Wallet Creation API in the Blockchain API Middleware.
The API will receive wallet creation requests from external systems such as Angular, Spring Boot, Postman, or curl, submit the wallet creation transaction to Hyperledger Fabric, insert the wallet record into PostgreSQL, insert an audit log, and return a standard API response.

1. API Endpoint
POST /api/v1/wallets
Full local URL:
http://127.0.0.1:3001/api/v1/wallets

2. Go to API Project
cd /home/nix/u01/blockchain-integration/blockchain-api

3. Install Required Package
npm install pg dotenv

4. Create Wallet Route
Create file:
nano src/routes/wallet.routes.js
Paste:
const express = require("express");const router = express.Router();const walletController = require("../controllers/wallet.controller");/** * @route   POST /api/v1/wallets * @desc    Create blockchain wallet * @access  Internal / API Gateway */router.post("/", walletController.createWallet);module.exports = router;
Validate:
node -c src/routes/wallet.routes.js

